## Flutter SDK configuration
# sdk.dir=/path/to/android/sdk
# flutter.sdk=/path/to/flutter

## Google Maps Platform Android Development Key
# Obtain a restricted API key (Maps SDK for Android, package com.freshmarket.app, debug SHA-1)
# and add it to your local android/local.properties file. Never commit real keys to Git.
MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_DEVELOPMENT_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE
